  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the brown lentils, salt, and black pepper. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add 2 cups of water to the saucepan and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes, or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Stir in the mentaiko and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve hot.",
    "Serve with a side of steamed vegetables or a salad, if desired."
